01:35:46.840 --> 01:35:52.840
...is a boomerang tossed away.

01:35:53.490 --> 01:36:00.200
Maybe, maybe, maybe love...

01:36:00.270 --> 01:36:06.210
...is a boomerang tossed away.

01:36:06.740 --> 01:36:13.250
Maybe, maybe, maybe love...

01:36:13.390 --> 01:36:19.500
...is a boomerang tossed away.

